Version: 5

# Note: at the moment (Sep 2026), uscan downloads a tarball from
# api.github.com/repos/openssl/openssl/tarball/, and it's not the same as the
# tarball from github.com/openssl/openssl/releases/ (same content but different
# hash). Because of that, signature verification fails, and to fix it you must
# drop the tarball downloaded by uscan, and replace it with the tarball that
# you download manually. Likely reported at #1118383 and #1120727.
Template: GitHub
Dist: https://github.com/openssl/openssl
Release-Only: yes
Custom-Version: openssl-(3\.0\.\d+)
